    "message": "[ipa-delivery:720] build(delivery): request the private common IPA 720 again (first attempt failed on a Swift call name of MeloNX lot 9; fixed and refrozen)\n\nRefrozen manifest build-utils/delivery/720.json on the delivered 719 (freeze\ncommit e53126a6, effective digest be9afa4f, 7476 product files, seven\nreviewed commits, legal check passed). Same components as the first request:\nMeloNX Core 719 pin 864dc08c, RPCS3 Core 918 unchanged from the base, the\npatched MoltenVK rebuild 6d3a8d03. The fix 65a9e633 changes the effective\ntree, so the flutter and native groups run fresh again.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Fable 5.2 <noreply@anthropic.com>\nClaude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_012mUAShv9k6pSCnpW7oAF63",
